  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach chest opened during the
    run adds 2% weapon damage to this ally, up to 30%, applied when the next battle
    is prepared.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Enemy health: +10%\nRun / Score
    multiplier: +10%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA
    sky fisher whose safety line was tied to the wrong shore. A keeper called the
    tightening tether protection. They carry their own spool now and search for the
    crew on the other side.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, gain 0 gold
    directly. This is not kill loot and does not count as collecting a coin.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: astral, archer. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
